[h1]Auto Theme[/h1]
[b]Preview 0.2.0 · Single-player only · Not verified in-game[/b]

Arrange all standard Great Works slots, including relics, writing, music and corporation products.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
Click Arrange Great Works during your turn. Preserve existing themes; form new themes first, then improve supported placements. Bounded heuristics do not guarantee an optimal result.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
The target setup is Gathering Storm with Harmony in Diversity. Real-game, save/load and current HD compatibility have not been verified. Multiplayer and hotseat are unsupported. Avoid assigning the same objects to another automation mod.

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Include game/DLC/HD versions, enabled mods, reproduction steps and relevant Lua.log or Modding.log errors.

